# Build context is the repo root (both images need shared files). Keep it
# small, and keep secrets out of every layer: .env must never be COPY-able.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
.git
.github
.claude
claude
docs
**/*.md
!**/README.md
apps/web/e2e
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
infra/docker/.data
infra/backup/.drill
